  "bio": "Charlie Cu, based in Atlanta, United States, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black & gray and realism styles. Their dedication to their craft is evident in every intricate detail and nuance of shading they bring to life on their clients' skin. Charlie insists on working by appointment only, ensuring that each piece is given the attention it deserves in a professional environment.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Atlanta, Georgia, United States\n\nSpecializing in Realism & Illustration Tattoos\nPrivate Studio | Sandy Springs, GA\nTattoo Inquiries: 678-386-8060 \ncharliecu.com",
